# -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated PDFs are binary and must never be line-ending converted.
#
# Git's automatic binary detection looks for a NUL byte in the first 8 KB, and a PDF's header and
# object table are plain ASCII, so it can misclassify a manual as text. With core.autocrlf=true that
# injects a CR before every LF on checkout, which shifts every xref offset and produces a file no
# reader will open. The rule below is general on purpose, so future generated manuals are covered
# the moment they are added.
# -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.pdf binary
